{"title":"Discount produces fractional cents charged to gateway","detail":"`total` starts as integer cents, but the percentage calculation yields a fractional number (2997 cents at 10% off becomes 2697.3). `PaymentGateway.charge` accepts `amountCents`, so the service passes a non-integer amount that a gateway may reject or round inconsistently, producing an incorrect charge. Keep the calculation in integer cents and apply an explicit rounding policy (for example, `Math.round(total * (100 - percentOff) / 100)`).","file":"src/checkout.ts","line":27,"line_quote":"        total = total * (1 - applied.percentOff / 100);","symbol":"CheckoutService.checkout","category":"correctness","severity":"major","pre_existing":false,"id":"b6144457dc9ab3bf","finders":["correctness","security","design"],"consensus":"consensus","vote":{"id":"b6144457dc9ab3bf","verdict":"valid","reason":"voter1: 第27行对整数分总额做百分比乘法，2997 分打九折得 2697.3，非整数分被直接传给 charge(amountCents)。问题确实存在，建议的整数取整策略合理。","evidence":{"file":"src/checkout.ts","line":27}},"status":"open","timestamp":"2026-10-28T15:16:54.544Z","runId":"b529805c-68bd-4971-ac92-b7a7d4e7b47f","riskScore":9,"riskLevel":"high","effectiveTier":"standard"}
{"title":"Usage cap is off by one and not enforced atomically","detail":"`usedCount > maxUses` allows a redemption when `usedCount === maxUses`, so every code can be used one extra time; `maxUses: 0` also permits one use. The check at this line is separate from the increment at line 29, so concurrent checkouts can both pass and exceed the cap. Reject with `usedCount >= maxUses` and make the increment conditional/atomic (for example, `UPDATE ... WHERE usedCount < maxUses` with an affected-row check).","file":"src/checkout.ts","line":46,"line_quote":"    if (dc.usedCount > dc.maxUses) return null;","symbol":"CheckoutService.lookupCode","category":"correctness","severity":"major","pre_existing":false,"id":"c951bf7454c2b724","finders":["correctness","security","design"],"consensus":"consensus","vote":{"id":"c951bf7454c2b724","verdict":"valid","reason":"voter1: 第46行使用 usedCount > maxUses，usedCount 等于 maxUses 时仍放行，maxUses=0 也可用一次；第46行读取与第29行自增分离，并发可越过上限。","evidence":{"file":"src/checkout.ts","line":46}},"status":"open","timestamp":"2026-10-28T15:16:54.544Z","runId":"b529805c-68bd-4971-ac92-b7a7d4e7b47f","riskScore":9,"riskLevel":"high","effectiveTier":"standard"}
{"title":"Discount code is interpolated into SQL","detail":"`discountCode` is caller-controlled and is interpolated directly into the lookup SQL. A payload such as `' OR '1'='1' --` makes the predicate always true, and `UNION SELECT` can fabricate a 100%-off row; drivers that allow multiple statements widen the impact. The usage UPDATE also interpolates `applied.id`, so parameterize both queries (`WHERE code = $1`, `WHERE id = $1`) instead of building SQL strings.","file":"src/checkout.ts","line":42,"line_quote":"    const rows = await this.db.query(`SELECT * FROM discount_codes WHERE code = '${code}'`);","symbol":"CheckoutService.lookupCode","category":"security","severity":"critical","pre_existing":false,"id":"25100a846e7ac036","finders":["correctness","security","design"],"consensus":"consensus","vote":{"id":"25100a846e7ac036","verdict":"valid","reason":"voter1: 第42行把调用方传入的 code 直接拼进 SQL，可注入恒真条件或 UNION 伪造折扣行；第29行同样拼接 applied.id，两处都应参数化。","evidence":{"file":"src/checkout.ts","line":42}},"status":"open","timestamp":"2026-10-28T15:16:54.544Z","runId":"b529805c-68bd-4971-ac92-b7a7d4e7b47f","riskScore":9,"riskLevel":"high","effectiveTier":"standard"}
